// The spells' recorded sounds (scripts/build-sounds.js): each school's casts, landings and missiles,
// tier by tier, the arcane bolt and hit, and the tome spells. All CC0 or public domain, each source's
// page saying so (checked 2026-10-07). Each made of real things standing in for magic: fire, rock,
// wind, sparks and thunder, water, steam and ice, bells, chimes, a singing bowl, glass, bowed metal,
// whispers. Each school keeps its sound up its tiers, growing longer, denser and lower rather than
// louder: Low (tiers 1-2), Mid (3-5), High (6-7; healing's 5). A cast swells to its release, loudest
// at its end; a landing starts at once. Levelled to -20 dBFS by its loudest 30 ms; `peak` is when
// it's loudest (s), to time a cast to its release.

